x←getFloatValue val;s
⍝ Read float from duckdb_value via varchar path.
⍝ This avoids platform-sensitive F4 return marshalling in ⎕NA.
:If val=0
    x←0
    →0
:EndIf
s←getVarcharValue val
:Trap 0
    x←⍎s
:Else
    ⍝ Fallback to direct getter if parsing fails.
    x←api.duckdb_get_float val
:EndTrap
